==Battleground==
*1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns.
*1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Super Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Super Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Metal Seal]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*20 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Madam Peng]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Malizabeth]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Ranger]], and [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Ranger]] to deal with the Dark enemies, [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]] to handle the metals. Mini-Waves could become be a problem, so you'll want [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] to shield your Catasauruses from Malizabeth while you begin building up a sizeable stack of them. If all goes well, you'll create an impenetrable fortress, and that momentum will take you right to the enemy base like a knife through butter.

